Midnight
  Midnight is a difficult universe,
the action takes place in the dead
of night.  Enemy forces surround your
singular airstrip, and intelligence
information is non-existent.
  Since there is only one airstrip,
don't use the 'New Tower' option,
even if all the MO's in RDU are done.

Welcome to Henderson Field.

